    "type": "game",
    "name": "Car Tuning\u00a0Garage\u00a0Simulator",
    "steam_appid": 3700840,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\ude98 Your Garage, Your Rules</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build the ultimate car collection and become the master of tuning. From legendary supercars to vintage classics and rare exotics - discover, purchase, or uncover hidden gems and bring them back to life.<br><br>Every car has a story - and you're the one rewriting it with your vision and skills. Whether you're collecting icons or crafting unique machines, your garage is where dreams take shape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f Total Control, Infinite Customization</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to your personal tuning workshop - where every bolt matters.<br>Dive deep into visual customization: swap out body parts, install widebody kits, spoilers, wheels, lights, and more. Shape the car\u2019s look down to the finest detail.<br>Go under the hood with performance tuning: upgrade engines, tweak suspension, adjust transmissions, improve braking systems and exhausts to create the perfect driving machine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow your business:<br> \ud83d\udd13 Expand your workshop with new zones, tools, and workstations.<br> \ud83d\udce6 Unlock new parts and tuning options as you progress.<br> \ud83e\uddfe Take on custom orders from demanding clients - turn their ideas into reality and earn reputation and rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you\u2019re restoring a rusted shell or crafting a street beast from scratch, the possibilities are endless.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfc1 Build It. Drive It. Dominate the Streets.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel the adrenaline as you take your builds out for a spin!<br> Put your creations to the test on specialized racetracks, test circuits, and open city streets. Every change you make affects handling, acceleration, and performance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2699\ufe0f Tune it.<br> \ud83d\udd25 Push it.<br> \ud83d\udea6 Race it.<br> The world is your proving ground. Master each surface, condition, and curve.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Share your finest work, show off your unique style, and let your creativity speak louder than words. Whether you're building a drift missile, a low-rider masterpiece, or a time-attack monster - Car Tuning Simulator gives you the tools to express your passion and compete with the best.<br><br>\ud83d\udee0 Ready to build the ultimate ride?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hit that Wishlist button and be the first to enter the garage when the doors open.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\ude98 Your Garage, Your Rules</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build the ultimate car collection and become the master of tuning. From legendary supercars to vintage classics and rare exotics - discover, purchase, or uncover hidden gems and bring them back to life.<br><br>Every car has a story - and you're the one rewriting it with your vision and skills. Whether you're collecting icons or crafting unique machines, your garage is where dreams take shape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f Total Control, Infinite Customization</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to your personal tuning workshop - where every bolt matters.<br>Dive deep into visual customization: swap out body parts, install widebody kits, spoilers, wheels, lights, and more. Shape the car\u2019s look down to the finest detail.<br>Go under the hood with performance tuning: upgrade engines, tweak suspension, adjust transmissions, improve braking systems and exhausts to create the perfect driving machine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow your business:<br> \ud83d\udd13 Expand your workshop with new zones, tools, and workstations.<br> \ud83d\udce6 Unlock new parts and tuning options as you progress.<br> \ud83e\uddfe Take on custom orders from demanding clients - turn their ideas into reality and earn reputation and rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you\u2019re restoring a rusted shell or crafting a street beast from scratch, the possibilities are endless.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfc1 Build It. Drive It. Dominate the Streets.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel the adrenaline as you take your builds out for a spin!<br> Put your creations to the test on specialized racetracks, test circuits, and open city streets. Every change you make affects handling, acceleration, and performance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2699\ufe0f Tune it.<br> \ud83d\udd25 Push it.<br> \ud83d\udea6 Race it.<br> The world is your proving ground. Master each surface, condition, and curve.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Share your finest work, show off your unique style, and let your creativity speak louder than words. Whether you're building a drift missile, a low-rider masterpiece, or a time-attack monster - Car Tuning Simulator gives you the tools to express your passion and compete with the best.<br><br>\ud83d\udee0 Ready to build the ultimate ride?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hit that Wishlist button and be the first to enter the garage when the doors open.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "Build your dream garage, customize every detail, and tune high-performance machines. Restore classics, fulfill client orders, and race your creations on streets and tracks. Car Tuning Simulator is your ultimate playground for creativity and car culture.",
